    "description": {
      "value": "Your parents conceived you for a fell purpose at a site tainted by death, like a wight's barrow, mass grave, or ossuary. Their reasons could be a mystery, or you might know of their grand design and seek to escape\u2014or fulfill\u2014their plans. Either way, you're at your most dangerous when near death.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Constitution, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Undead Lore skill. You gain the Final Spite reaction.\n\n**Final Spite**\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** You're reduced to 0 Hit Points\n\nYou make a Strike before falling unconscious."
    },
